{"schemaVersion": "svg-plan-ledger-v1", "source": {"exam": "archive/exams/original/middle/m2/1final/24_향림중_1학기_기말_중2_기출.js", "sourceOrdinal": 7, "sourceId": 7, "sourceCommit": "ca5644a44f62d8917c2df9a1b7d95353491589cc", "sourceBlobSha": "424bc0ab0b44793209c0328362c2059af9fba651"}, "scope": "original", "existing": {"inventoryStatus": "INVENTORIED", "problemAssets": ["archive/assets/images/24_향림중_1학기_기말_중2_기출/q7-problem-visual-v2.svg"], "solutionAssets": [], "visualReview": "SVG_SOURCE_ONLY", "checkedCommit": "ca5644a44f62d8917c2df9a1b7d95353491589cc"}, "need": {"problem": "KEEP", "solution": "FIGURE", "why": "종이n장의가로는6n−(n−1)=5n+1,넓이30n+6. 첫행실수조건n≥59/5,둘째행정수후보11/12의제외/포함을비교한다. 최소12장. 실제정수해는12하나가아니라12이상자연수전체이다. 가로종이수n,세로T=(S−6)/30으로넓이S를정확변환한다. 실제S=30n+6은T=n이고S360경계는T59/5. 11장T11→336,12장T12→366이라최소12. 실제종이수는자연수이며연속선은조건비교보조이다."}, "plan": {"files": ["q07-solution-1.json", "q07-solution-2.json"], "status": "PLAN_WRITTEN", "render": "NOT_RUN"}, "checks": {"existingVisualReviewed": false, "newPlanVisualReviewed": false, "coordsVerified": true}, "publication": {"state": "UNVERIFIED", "evidence": "집PC 실제렌더·모바일확인전게시금지. 원본유지."}}
